package Relators

// Core types
kind Person
kind BreakfastPlace

// Category: Relator only
// Example: Marriage between two persons (John and Mary)
// We do not introduce a separate material relation; we use the relator
relator Marriage mediates Person, Person

// Category: Relator plus derived material relation
// Example: Employment between a person (e.g., a cook) and a breakfast place (e.g., Sunrise)
// The material relation `worksFor` is derived from the relator `Employment`
relator Employment mediates Person, BreakfastPlace
material worksFor derives Employment
